<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>SGE - Cargar Notas</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100">

<div class="flex min-h-screen">

    <aside class="w-72 bg-slate-900 text-white p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
            <div class="mb-10">
                <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">
                    SGE <span class="text-emerald-400">DOCENTE</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Panel Académico</p>
            </div>

            <nav class="space-y-3">
                <a href="/teacher/dashboard" class="flex items-center gap-3 hover:bg-white/10 p-3 rounded transition text-gray-200">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high"></i> Dashboard
                </a>
                <a href="/teacher/comisiones" class="flex items-center gap-3 hover:bg-white/10 p-3 rounded transition text-gray-200">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-users-rectangle"></i> Gestión de Comisiones
                </a>
                
                <a href="/teacher/grades" class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-emerald-500/20 border-l-4 border-emerald-400 p-3 rounded text-white font-semibold">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pen text-emerald-400"></i> Cargar Notas
                </a>
                
                <a href="/teacher/tasks" class="flex items-center gap-3 hover:bg-white/10 p-3 rounded transition text-gray-200">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> Publicar Tareas
                </a>
                <a href="/teacher/exams" class="flex items-center gap-3 hover:bg-white/10 p-3 rounded transition text-gray-200">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-list-ol"></i> Ver Inscriptos a Finales
                </a>
            </nav>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-16">
            <a href="/logout" class="block text-center border border-red-500 text-red-400 hover:bg-red-500 hover:text-white transition rounded p-3">Cerrar Sesión</a>
        </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="flex-1 p-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-6 mb-8">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800">✍️ Módulo de Calificaciones</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">Docente: <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">{{username}}</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-12 text-center text-gray-500">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-5xl mb-4 text-emerald-300"></i>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-700 mb-2">Sección de Notas</h3>
            <p>Aquí irá la tabla para que selecciones a los alumnos y cargues sus calificaciones de cursada o exámenes.</p>
        </div>
    </main>

</div>
</body>
</html>